{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-14T04:31:33.376Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e4ea614e8e22bcd43a8d6917","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"ops-third-party-publish-wrappers"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Recognize third-party publish wrappers (semantic-release, np, release-it, lerna publish, changeset publish) in the canonical attestation auditor"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"CodeRabbit on pm-ops#162 noted that npm-installed publish wrappers invoke npm publish from dependency source outside the tracked repository. isExecutableSource covers tracked wrappers only. Track recognition and fail-closed provenance auditing for semantic-release, np, release-it, lerna publish, and changeset publish; implementation is out of scope for the braces dependency PR."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-14T04:31:33.376Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-14T04:31:33.376Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Recognize semantic-release, np, release-it, lerna publish, and changeset publish in package scripts and workflow run steps.; Fail closed when wrapper provenance cannot be certified, without executing or publishing anything.; Add real scratch repository regressions for each wrapper, plus non-publish lerna and changeset controls and tracked-wrapper coverage.; Document the dependency-source boundary and wrapper diagnostics; retain existing attestation regressions and unchanged coverage thresholds."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Create a scratch repository with a package script or release workflow invoking each npm-installed wrapper; omit direct npm publish and tracked wrapper source; run the canonical attestation auditor and inspect whether it recognizes a publish path or incorrectly reports no publish commands."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Known dependency publish wrappers are recognized and unresolved provenance is refused with actionable diagnostics."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Tracked executable source is audited, but npm-installed publish wrappers can hide the publish path from source scanning."}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"9600392a50f84e2943dc730ec50817328c831305f26a2f379fc0db5aafba2aa1","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"c37bf6b4eb729fe2a11bb65b3c862ffd1316fd06d571a473146da3a6673dc591"}
